# VREL is radial relative speed and follows the time derivative of its DREL record.
# AREL follows VREL's time derivative. YVREL remains a candidate, not interface input.
# The 6-bit record validity codes mark populated records; no stable sensor ID was identified.
# Bits 86 and 222 remain unscaled raw fields.

